[38;5;231m⏺[39m Added a checkbox to [38;5;153mindex.html:16-19[39m.

  - Native [38;5;153m<input type="checkbox">[39m holds the on/off state — no JS needed.
  - Wrapped in a [38;5;153m<label>[39m so clicking the text toggles it too (and it's accessible by default).
  - One CSS rule strikes through the label when checked, so "done" is visible.

  To add more tasks, duplicate the [38;5;153m<label class="task">[39m block and change the text.

  Not done: no persistence (state resets on reload) and no tests — the repo has no test setup. Say the word if you want
  either, or a JS-driven list instead of hardcoded items.

